<title>USA: Insituform board names Hooper chairman.</title>
<headline>Insituform board names Hooper chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insituform Technologies Inc said Monday that Anthony Hooper has been elected chairman, replacing Jerome Kalishman.</p>
<p>A statement from the company said Hooper would continue as president and chief executive, but it provided no details on Kalishman's departure.</p>
<p>No one at the company's offices returned a call Monday evening seeking further information.</p>
<p>Insituform Technologies provides proprietary trenchless technologies for the rehabilitation and improvement of sewer, water, gas and industrial pipe.</p>
</text>
